{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":63813,\"title\":\"Blue Eyes\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"High adrenaline Swedish political thriller from the creative talent behind Humans – An extreme right-wing party is heading towards its best election result when the chief of staff at the Justice Department disappears without a trace. Racism, immigration and nationalism are explored in this series praised by New York Times.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xEAmFHk761J0XeUE1EX9YiWaQOo.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/d7d5CyGZhjWLRQcHI3XFAQBHFTP.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":7.6,\"voteCount\":15,\"year\":2014,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\",\"War & Politics\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":10,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"SVT1\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"SE\",\"name\":\"Sweden\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2015-02-08\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":212825,\"name\":\"Henrik Georgsson\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q0N4KFGx7h2UfSP8M0q7M0D8Kmd.jpg\"},{\"id\":1167002,\"name\":\"Louise Peterhoff\",\"character\":\"Elin Hammar\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hpLjNXQNdEkCnkvqC26TwCT722l.jpg\"},{\"id\":47176,\"name\":\"Sven Nordin\",\"character\":\"Gunnar Elvestad\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sG1XzoM9UtxgbObA3tX7el30VfO.jpg\"},{\"id\":1374818,\"name\":\"Karin Franz Körlof\",\"character\":\"Sofia Nilsson\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/prjHFZUjrF06OqmC6TM56CW7yUF.jpg\"},{\"id\":1549653,\"name\":\"David Lindström\",\"character\":\"Simon Nilsson\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sXhPh4YmIWbyppNVfzKMakAtTo9.jpg\"},{\"id\":135695,\"name\":\"Kjell Wilhelmsen\",\"character\":\"Olle Nordlöf\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ecvGG97NXVSiwPGLf1Junc287Oa.jpg\"},{\"id\":1167004,\"name\":\"Anna Bjelkerud\",\"character\":\"Annika Nilsson\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gfmAf9OoIPA3A65BjP1wpSLED0y.jpg\"},{\"id\":526011,\"name\":\"Adam Lundgren\",\"character\":\"Mattias Cedergren\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hB62780sPK5HpHBylShEsrtfIh1.jpg\"},{\"id\":592422,\"name\":\"Erik Johansson\",\"character\":\"Gustav Åkerlund\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ztbOB6sNAgd1veRLoGS1WaTW5Ei.jpg\"},{\"id\":11047,\"name\":\"Cecilia Frode\",\"character\":\"Rebecka Lundström\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6RafvLVdr9KAWwjBw91Rk4LI5M5.jpg\"},{\"id\":140819,\"name\":\"Linus Wahlgren\",\"character\":\"Max Åhman\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cUCkqcJivuryXnvTSXKpfikJtEJ.jpg\"},{\"id\":107577,\"name\":\"Niklas Hjulström\",\"character\":\"Statsminister\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/21cgnu24UbVe30puh6FqijJx0bm.jpg\"},{\"id\":1199647,\"name\":\"Meliz Karlge\",\"character\":\"Sarah Farzin\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/udGmdiEhUGf9asHEu7oWRym1S5x.jpg\"},{\"id\":1457976,\"name\":\"Daniel Larsson\",\"character\":\"Ludwig Biehlers\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/erl9G9jJWyaByWlFVLujhrAcodc.jpg\"},{\"id\":144694,\"name\":\"Małgorzata Pieczyńska\",\"character\":\"Janina Hansson\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/b8TOorlOlomLiDZqgvbc6p1vkZW.jpg\"},{\"id\":986805,\"name\":\"Filip Berg\",\"character\":\"Kristoffer Palm\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e3bcKd5ZnTjAVEanGaji5dffu5f.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"5sz4GpVH_R8\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"sNEGkSqDAug\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"JQTBTTPHHP8\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":2687,\"title\":\"Mister Sterling\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eFcmYnK6NZMccvUPTzRl7mrUNGi.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.28057395143487857,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":62814,\"title\":\"The Family\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AciJALZmd0SOMht1QVyPAjpnfFE.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2803030303030303,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":31766,\"title\":\"Wallander\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fTyD5mKW6Id4vb7qQN5D81s6waX.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2725490196078431,\"_genreOverlap\":2}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"Taut, contemporary thriller from Sweden set in the run-up to a general election as, behind the political scenes, a series of terror attacks are planned to send shock waves through the nation.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qU043Iu07qooRyjedUcMFmFWEMX.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2014-11-30\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Let the Party Begin\",\"overview\":\"When the Justice Department's chief of staff vanishes without a trace, her replacement begins to suspect a cover-up. An extreme right-wing political party's local representative is brutally murdered.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fRwHoSVUnCRSswRwqmGJsniGrnJ.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2014-11-30\",\"runtime\":57},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"A Thousand Pinpricks\",\"overview\":\"Annika's far-right political party sees her murder as an opportunity to win more votes. Nazi terrorist cell Veritas emerges from obscurity to carry out a co-ordinated series of violent attacks.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lGLnrXjQJXOFbs5RBsom7Ko4kT6.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2014-12-07\",\"runtime\":58},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Ashes to Ashes\",\"overview\":\"The terror attacks by Veritas leave the government in crisis and confusion. Elin realises that attempts have been made to cover up Sarah's disappearance. Sofia stumbles upon a xenophobic chat forum.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vaWFcv7rQ9y3kFyrLh7H3l1pbrb.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2014-12-14\",\"runtime\":59},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Migratory Birds\",\"overview\":\"Elin receives a phone call from a terrified Sarah, who wants to arrange a secret meeting. Janina confronts Olle and Kristoffer when a large amount of money goes missing from their campaign funds.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9y6l9HQddFfmpov4d3E3jVZ2SS9.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2014-12-21\",\"runtime\":57},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Care Home\",\"overview\":\"Simon sees the move to Stockholm isn't the fresh start Sofia promised. Elin grows increasingly unsure about whether to trust Max. The director of a company providing care homes is abducted by Veritas.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/y0ilaF2DSbaMSxfN1WP7j2OxyCu.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2015-01-04\",\"runtime\":59},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"My Parents' Lies\",\"overview\":\"The outcome of the abduction case shocks the nation. Olle confesses to Janina that he did give Sofia money. Elin's flat is broken into and she discovers who falsified Sarah's application for leave.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8XoQVEYVzM1fkQOsY5oTQJp95Ru.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2015-01-11\",\"runtime\":59},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"The Earthquake\",\"overview\":\"The police strongly suspect that Veritas is planning a major terror attack. Elin struggles to understand why Gunnar has been lying. Olle turns up unexpectedly at the Veritas hideout looking for Sofia.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pc7QvO7lwJaeJTyCNBszo6bVy9h.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2015-01-18\",\"runtime\":58},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"The Surge\",\"overview\":\"Veritas has executed another terror attack but what is the target? Is it  linked to the kidnapping of the five-year-old son of the deputy head of  security at Stockholm Stock Exchange, two days earlier?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9JMXjXN1cZd1Wlg42R2X9oOzw9J.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2015-01-25\",\"runtime\":58},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"The Wake\",\"overview\":\"Elin is contacted by an unexpected party who suggests a collaboration, but can this new ally be trusted? The police identify Gustav through CCTV pictures. He is now the most wanted man in Sweden.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/swUMqyKwVddT9seURkQoSgZ70Ee.jpg\",\"rating\":4.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-01\",\"runtime\":59},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"A Sunday in September\",\"overview\":\"After the shocking events of the last few days, a battered nation goes to the polls. Elin is about to uncover one of the most corrupt and scandalous political conspiracies Sweden has ever known.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AdPrARsOd540h2B1jfk8blzeEFM.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-08\",\"runtime\":59}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2014-11-30\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}